       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Acetaminophen 3000 mg three times daily comes to 9,000 mg/day. That's more than double the usual adult maximum of 4,000 mg/day, and some institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. A dose that high carries a serious risk of acute liver injury, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1,000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day total)\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day total)\n- **500\u20131,000 mg PO every 6\u20138 hours**, not to exceed your institution's daily maximum\n- **3,000 mg/day total**, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want the original 3000 mg three times daily, please confirm that. I'd also suggest talking with pharmacy first."
